<body>
<div class="container py-5">
  <!-- Page Title -->
  <div class="text-center mb-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold">Welcome to the Parish Admin Page</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Working together to serve our parish community
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4">
    <!-- MAIN WELCOME CARD -->
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 h-100">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <h4 class="mb-3">Welcome, Catalina, Samantha & Carina!</h4>
          <p>
            Thank you for your generosity and willingness to serve our parish
            by helping manage and maintain our website.
          </p>
          <p>
            This admin area is your shared workspace. Each section of the site
            includes short instructions to guide you, so you can work with
            confidence and clarity.
          </p>

          <hr>

          <h6 class="fw-bold mt-4">Your Roles</h6>

          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Catalina & Samantha</strong> – primarily responsible for the
              <strong>Events</strong> section: uploading photos and making visual
              adjustments (such as background images or other design updates).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Carina</strong> – responsible for posting current
              information, such as changes in Mass times or office hours,
              and for preparing and uploading the weekly bulletin PDF.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-3">
            Please note that the <strong>Communities and Groups</strong> pages
            are not active yet.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            Thank you again for your dedication. I truly hope that our
            collaboration on this parish website brings satisfaction to us
            and serves our parishioners well.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
<!-- SIDE IMAGE CARD -->
    <div class="col-lg-4">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 bg-light h-100 text-center">

        <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column justify-content-center p-4">

          <!-- Gospel-inspired illustration -->
          <img src="/images/parish/loaves-and-fishes.webp"
              alt="Gospel illustration - multiplication of loaves"
              class="img-fluid rounded mb-3">

          <h6 class="fw-bold">Working Together</h6>

          <p class="small text-muted mb-2">
            “They all ate and were satisfied.”  
            <br><em>Mark 6:42</em>
          </p>

          <p class="small mb-0">
            When we share our gifts, even small efforts
            can nourish many.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

</body>

